 : 767px) { } What to expect? All tools\, aprons\, clay\, glaze\, moulds ar
 e supplied. Wheel throwing - Beginners will learn to create simple cup and
  ceramic bowl forms. Intermediate and practiced potters can explore advanc
 ed shapes like ceramic plates or taller pieces. Grace will handle trimming
  and glazing. Hand building workshop - You can focus on one large ceramic 
 art piece or create 3 to 5 smaller works. You’ll learn a mix of pinch po
 t\, coiling\, and slab-building techniques used in handmade pottery. Prici
 ng Wheel throwing Each person will have their own wheel. Includes 3-5 whee
 l thrown pieces. Trimmed\, fired and glazed in your choice of glaze. $350 
